{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24347","headline":"荅梦得秋庭独坐见赠 · 白居易","name":"荅梦得秋庭独坐见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林梢隐映夕阳残，庭际萧疎夜气寒。\n霜草欲枯虫思急，风枝未定鸟栖难。\n容衰见镜同惆怅，身健逢杯且喜欢。\n应是天教相煖热，一时垂老与闲宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}